+                         Content-Length = length of the returned body.
+  Ranges are inclusive of the end; an end past EOF is clamped;
+  bytes=-N means the last N bytes.
+- Range with start beyond EOF, zero suffix, reverse bounds, bad syntax,
+  or any range on empty data:
+                         416, empty body, Content-Range: bytes */<length>.
+"""
+
